  "latex": "\\mathcal{O}_{Y'} = \\mathcal{O}_Y \\times_{f_*\\mathcal{O}_X} f'_*\\mathcal{O}_{X'}",
  "name": "lemma · Pushouts in the category of schemes, I",
  "en": "lemma-pushout-along-thickening",
  "importance": 0.67,
  "family": "map",
  "summary": "Let $X \\to X'$ be a thickening of schemes and let $X \\to Y$ be an affine morphism of schemes.…",
  "detail": "Let $X \\to X'$ be a thickening of schemes and let $X \\to Y$ be an affine morphism of schemes. Then there exists a pushout $$ \\xymatrix{ X \\ar[r] \\ar[d]_f & X' \\ar[d]^{f'} \\\\ Y \\ar[r] & Y' } $$ in the category of schemes. Moreover, $Y \\subset Y'$ is a thickening, $X = Y \\times_{Y'} X'$, and $$ \\mathcal{O}_{Y'} = \\mathcal{O}_Y \\times_{f_*\\mathcal{O}_X} f'_*\\mathcal{O}_{X'} $$ as sheaves on $|Y| = |Y'|$.",
