  "family": "map",
  "summary": "Let $f : X \\to S$ be a morphism of schemes. Assume $f$ is locally of finite type. We say $f$ is of {\\it relative dimension $\\leq d$ at $x$} if $\\dim_x(X_{f(x)})…",
  "detail": "Let $f : X \\to S$ be a morphism of schemes. Assume $f$ is locally of finite type. We say $f$ is of {\\it relative dimension $\\leq d$ at $x$} if $\\dim_x(X_{f(x)}) \\leq d$. We say $f$ is of {\\it relative dimension $\\leq d$} if $\\dim_x(X_{f(x)}) \\leq d$ for all $x \\in X$. We say $f$ is of {\\it relative dimension $d$} if all nonempty fibres $X_s$ are equidimensional of dimension $d$.",
