  "summary": "With $Z \\subset S$ and $f : X \\to S$ as above. Given a quasi-coherent $\\mathcal{O}_X$-module $\\mathcal{F}$ the {\\it strict transform} of $\\mathcal{F}$ with resp…",
  "detail": "With $Z \\subset S$ and $f : X \\to S$ as above. Given a quasi-coherent $\\mathcal{O}_X$-module $\\mathcal{F}$ the {\\it strict transform} of $\\mathcal{F}$ with respect to the blowup of $S$ in $Z$ is the quotient $\\mathcal{F}'$ of $\\text{pr}_X^*\\mathcal{F}$ by the submodule of sections supported on $\\text{pr}_{S'}^{-1}E$. The {\\it strict transform} of $X$ is the closed subscheme $X' \\subset X \\times_S S'$ cut out by the quasi-coherent ideal of sections of $\\mathcal{O}_{X \\times_S S'}$ supported on $\\text{pr}_{S'}^{-1}E$.",
