  "summary": "Properties and base change. Let $\\mathcal{P}$ be a property of schemes over a base.…",
  "detail": "Properties and base change. Let $\\mathcal{P}$ be a property of schemes over a base. We say that $\\mathcal{P}$ is {\\it preserved under arbitrary base change}, or simply that $\\mathcal{P}$ is {\\it preserved under base change} if whenever $X/S$ has $\\mathcal{P}$, any base change $X_{S'}/S'$ has $\\mathcal{P}$. Let $\\mathcal{P}$ be a property of morphisms of schemes over a base. We say that $\\mathcal{P}$ is {\\it preserved under arbitrary base change}, or simply that {\\it preserved under base change} if whenever $f : X \\to Y$ over $S$ has $\\mathcal{P}$, any base change $f' : X_{S'} \\to Y_{S'}$ over $S'$ has $\\mathcal{P}$.",
