  "detail": "Let $\\mathcal{C}_i$, $i = 1, 2, 3$ be sites. Let $f : \\mathcal{C}_1 \\to \\mathcal{C}_2$ and $g : \\mathcal{C}_2 \\to \\mathcal{C}_3$ be morphisms of sites given by continuous functors $u : \\mathcal{C}_2 \\to \\mathcal{C}_1$ and $v : \\mathcal{C}_3 \\to \\mathcal{C}_2$. The {\\it composition} $g \\circ f$ is the morphism of sites corresponding to the functor $u \\circ v$.",
