  "detail": "Let $S \\in \\Ob(\\Sch_{fppf})$ be a scheme. Let $F$ be an algebraic space over $S$. A {\\it Zariski covering} $\\{F_i \\subset F\\}_{i \\in I}$ of $F$ is given by a set $I$ and a collection of open subspaces $F_i \\subset F$ such that $\\coprod F_i \\to F$ is a surjective map of sheaves.",
