  "summary": "Let $R$ be a ring. Let $S \\subset R$ be a multiplicative subset. The map $R \\to S^{-1}R$ induces via the functoriality of $\\Spec$ a homeomorphism $$ \\Spec(S^{-1…",
  "detail": "Let $R$ be a ring. Let $S \\subset R$ be a multiplicative subset. The map $R \\to S^{-1}R$ induces via the functoriality of $\\Spec$ a homeomorphism $$ \\Spec(S^{-1}R) \\longrightarrow \\{\\mathfrak p \\in \\Spec(R) \\mid S \\cap \\mathfrak p = \\emptyset \\} $$ where the topology on the right hand side is that induced from the Zariski topology on $\\Spec(R)$. The inverse map is given by $\\mathfrak p \\mapsto S^{-1}\\mathfrak p = \\mathfrak p(S^{-1}R)$.",
