  "latex": "t \\mapsto \\text{length}_{\\mathcal{O}_{X, \\xi}} \\mathcal{O}_{W, \\xi}/(f_1, \\ldots, f_c)^t,\\quad t \\gg 0.",
  "name": "lemma · Computing intersection multiplicities",
