  "summary": "Let $R$ be a ring. Let $\\varphi : R[x] \\to S$ be finite. Let $$ J = \\{ g \\in S \\mid gS \\subset \\Im(\\varphi)\\} $$ be the ``conductor ideal'' of $\\varphi$.…",
  "detail": "Let $R$ be a ring. Let $\\varphi : R[x] \\to S$ be finite. Let $$ J = \\{ g \\in S \\mid gS \\subset \\Im(\\varphi)\\} $$ be the ``conductor ideal'' of $\\varphi$. Assume $\\varphi(R) \\subset S$ integrally closed in $S$.",
