  "summary": "Let $R \\to S$ be a ring map. We say $S$ is {\\it formally smooth over $R$} if for every commutative solid diagram $$ \\xymatrix{ S \\ar[r] \\ar@{-->}[rd] & A/I \\\\ R…",
