  "summary": "Let $S$ be a scheme. Let $\\mathcal{E}$ be a quasi-coherent $\\mathcal{O}_S$-module\\footnote{The reader may expect here the condition that $\\mathcal{E}$ is finite…",
  "detail": "Let $S$ be a scheme. Let $\\mathcal{E}$ be a quasi-coherent $\\mathcal{O}_S$-module\\footnote{The reader may expect here the condition that $\\mathcal{E}$ is finite locally free. We do not do so in order to be consistent with \\cite[II, Definition 1.7.8]{EGA}.}. The {\\it vector bundle associated to $\\mathcal{E}$} is $$ \\mathbf{V}(\\mathcal{E}) = \\underline{\\Spec}_S(\\text{Sym}(\\mathcal{E})). $$",
