  "summary": "Let $\\mathcal{P}$ be a property of morphisms of schemes over a base. Let $\\tau \\in \\{Zariski, fpqc, fppf, \\etale, smooth, syntomic\\}$.…",
  "detail": "Let $\\mathcal{P}$ be a property of morphisms of schemes over a base. Let $\\tau \\in \\{Zariski, fpqc, fppf, \\etale, smooth, syntomic\\}$. We say {\\it morphisms of type $\\mathcal{P}$ satisfy descent for $\\tau$-coverings} if for any $\\tau$-covering $\\mathcal{U} : \\{U_i \\to S\\}_{i \\in I}$ (see Topologies, Section \\ref{topologies-section-procedure}), any descent datum $(X_i, \\varphi_{ij})$ relative to $\\mathcal{U}$ such that each morphism $X_i \\to U_i$ has property $\\mathcal{P}$ is effective.",
