  "summary": "A {\\it big h site} is any site $\\Sch_h$ as in Sites, Definition \\ref{sites-definition-site} constructed as follows: Choose any set of schemes $S_0$, and any set…",
  "detail": "A {\\it big h site} is any site $\\Sch_h$ as in Sites, Definition \\ref{sites-definition-site} constructed as follows: Choose any set of schemes $S_0$, and any set of h coverings $\\text{Cov}_0$ among these schemes. As underlying category take any category $\\Sch_\\alpha$ constructed as in Sets, Lemma \\ref{sets-lemma-construct-category} starting with the set $S_0$. Choose any set of coverings as in Sets, Lemma \\ref{sets-lemma-coverings-site} starting with the category $\\Sch_\\alpha$ and the class of h coverings, and the set $\\text{Cov}_0$ chosen above.",
