  "family": "cohomology",
  "summary": "Let $\\mathcal{C}$ be an abelian category. We say the inverse system $(A_i)$ satisfies the {\\it Mittag-Leffler condition}, or for short is {\\it ML}, if for every…",
  "detail": "Let $\\mathcal{C}$ be an abelian category. We say the inverse system $(A_i)$ satisfies the {\\it Mittag-Leffler condition}, or for short is {\\it ML}, if for every $i$ there exists a $c = c(i) \\geq i$ such that $$ \\Im(A_k \\to A_i) = \\Im(A_c \\to A_i) $$ for all $k \\geq c$.",
