  "summary": "Let $f : X \\to S$ be a morphism of schemes. Let $\\mathcal{L}$ be an invertible $\\mathcal{O}_X$-module.…",
  "detail": "Let $f : X \\to S$ be a morphism of schemes. Let $\\mathcal{L}$ be an invertible $\\mathcal{O}_X$-module. We say $\\mathcal{L}$ is {\\it relatively ample}, or {\\it $f$-relatively ample}, or {\\it ample on $X/S$}, or {\\it $f$-ample} if $f : X \\to S$ is quasi-compact, and if for every affine open $V \\subset S$ the restriction of $\\mathcal{L}$ to the open subscheme $f^{-1}(V)$ of $X$ is ample.",
