  "name": "lemma · Ring maps of finite type and of finite presentation",
  "en": "lemma-compose-finite-type",
  "importance": 0.54,
  "family": "foundation",
  "summary": "The notions finite type and finite presentation have the following permanence properties. A composition of ring maps of finite type is of finite type.…",
  "detail": "The notions finite type and finite presentation have the following permanence properties. A composition of ring maps of finite type is of finite type. A composition of ring maps of finite presentation is of finite presentation. Given $R \\to S' \\to S$ with $R \\to S$ of finite type, then $S' \\to S$ is of finite type. Given $R \\to S' \\to S$, with $R \\to S$ of finite presentation, and $R \\to S'$ of finite type, then $S' \\to S$ is of finite presentation.",
