  "detail": "Let $(S, \\delta)$ be as in Situation \\ref{situation-setup}. Let $i : Z \\to X$ be a regular closed immersion of codimension $r$ between schemes locally of finite type over $S$. Let $\\mathcal{N} = \\mathcal{C}_{Z/X}^\\vee$ be the normal sheaf. If $X$ is quasi-compact (or has quasi-compact irreducible components), then $c_t(Z \\to X, i_*\\mathcal{O}_Z) = 0$ for $t = 1, \\ldots, r - 1$ and $$ c_r(Z \\to X, i_*\\mathcal{O}_Z) = (-1)^{r - 1} (r - 1)! c(Z \\to X, \\mathcal{N}) \\quad\\text{in}\\quad A^r(Z \\to X) $$ where $c_t(Z \\to X, i_*\\mathcal{O}_Z)$ is the localized Chern class of Definition \\ref{definition-localized-chern}.",
