  "family": "scheme",
  "summary": "Let $(X, \\mathcal{O}_X) = (\\Spec(R), \\mathcal{O}_{\\Spec(R)})$ be an affine scheme. Let $\\mathcal{F}$ be a quasi-coherent $\\mathcal{O}_X$-module.…",
