  "en": "lemma-fibre-topological",
  "importance": 0.54,
  "family": "scheme",
  "summary": "Let $f : X \\to S$ be a morphism of schemes. Consider the diagrams $$ \\vcenter{ \\xymatrix{ X_s \\ar[r] \\ar[d] & X \\ar[d] \\\\ \\Spec(\\kappa(s)) \\ar[r] & S } } \\quad\\…",
  "detail": "Let $f : X \\to S$ be a morphism of schemes. Consider the diagrams $$ \\vcenter{ \\xymatrix{ X_s \\ar[r] \\ar[d] & X \\ar[d] \\\\ \\Spec(\\kappa(s)) \\ar[r] & S } } \\quad\\text{and}\\quad \\vcenter{ \\xymatrix{ \\Spec(\\mathcal{O}_{S, s}) \\times_S X \\ar[r] \\ar[d] & X \\ar[d] \\\\ \\Spec(\\mathcal{O}_{S, s}) \\ar[r] & S } } $$ In both cases these diagrams induce fibre squares of topological spaces and in particular, the top horizontal arrow is a homeomorphism onto its image.",
