  "latex": "K'_0(X) \\to K_0(D_{X, perf}(\\mathcal{O}_Y)) \\to A^*(X \\to Y) \\otimes \\mathbf{Q} \\to \\CH_*(X) \\otimes \\mathbf{Q}",
  "name": "proposition · Chow groups and K-groups revisited",
