  "detail": "Let $X$ be a Noetherian scheme. Then the functors $$ D^-(\\textit{Coh}(\\mathcal{O}_X)) \\longrightarrow D^-_{\\textit{Coh}}(\\mathcal{O}_X) \\quad\\text{and}\\quad D^b(\\textit{Coh}(\\mathcal{O}_X)) \\longrightarrow D^b_{\\textit{Coh}}(\\mathcal{O}_X) $$ are equivalences.",
