  "family": "scheme",
  "summary": "Let $k$ be a field. Let $X$ be a proper scheme over $k$ of dimension $d$. Let $\\mathcal{L}$ be an ample invertible $\\mathcal{O}_X$-module.…",
  "detail": "Let $k$ be a field. Let $X$ be a proper scheme over $k$ of dimension $d$. Let $\\mathcal{L}$ be an ample invertible $\\mathcal{O}_X$-module. Then $$ \\dim_k \\Gamma(X, \\mathcal{L}^{\\otimes n}) \\sim c n^d + l.o.t. $$ where $c = \\deg_\\mathcal{L}(X)/d!$ is a positive constant.",
