  "summary": "Let $\\mathcal{P}$ be a property of morphisms of schemes. Let $\\tau \\in \\{Zariski, \\linebreak[0] fpqc, \\linebreak[0] fppf, \\linebreak[0] \\etale, \\linebreak[0] sm…",
