  "latex": "\\mathcal{O}_S(D) = \\SheafHom_{\\mathcal{O}_S}(\\mathcal{I}_D, \\mathcal{O}_S) = \\mathcal{I}_D^{\\otimes -1}.",
  "name": "definition · Effective Cartier divisors and invertible sheaves",
