  "detail": "Let $X \\to S$ be a morphism of schemes. Let $\\mathcal{F}$ be a quasi-coherent $\\mathcal{O}_X$-module. We say that the {\\it universal flattening of $\\mathcal{F}$ exists} if the functor $F_{flat}$ defined in Situation \\ref{situation-flat} is representable by a scheme $S'$ over $S$. We say that the {\\it universal flattening of $X$ exists} if the universal flattening of $\\mathcal{O}_X$ exists.",
