  "summary": "Let $(R, \\mathfrak m)$ be a Noetherian local ring. Let $(M, \\varphi, \\psi)$ be a $(2, 1)$-periodic complex over $R$ with $M$ finite and with cohomology groups o…",
  "detail": "Let $(R, \\mathfrak m)$ be a Noetherian local ring. Let $(M, \\varphi, \\psi)$ be a $(2, 1)$-periodic complex over $R$ with $M$ finite and with cohomology groups of finite length over $R$. Let $x \\in R$ be such that $\\dim(\\text{Supp}(M/xM)) \\leq 0$. Then $$ e_R(M, x\\varphi, \\psi) = e_R(M, \\varphi, \\psi) - e_R(\\Im(\\varphi), 0, x) $$ and $$ e_R(M, \\varphi, x\\psi) = e_R(M, \\varphi, \\psi) + e_R(\\Im(\\psi), 0, x) $$",
