  "summary": "Let $(S, \\delta)$ be as in Situation \\ref{situation-setup}. Let $X$ be locally of finite type over $S$.…",
  "detail": "Let $(S, \\delta)$ be as in Situation \\ref{situation-setup}. Let $X$ be locally of finite type over $S$. Let $\\mathcal{L}$ be an invertible $\\mathcal{O}_X$-module. Let $Y \\subset X$ be a closed subscheme. Let $s \\in \\Gamma(Y, \\mathcal{L}|_Y)$. Assume $\\dim_\\delta(Y) \\leq k + 1$, $\\dim_\\delta(Z(s)) \\leq k$, and for every generic point $\\xi$ of an irreducible component of $Z(s)$ of $\\delta$-dimension $k$ the multiplication by $s$ induces an injection $\\mathcal{O}_{Y, \\xi} \\to (\\mathcal{L}|_Y)_\\xi$\\footnote{For example, this holds if $s$ is a regular section of $\\mathcal{L}|_Y$.}. Then $$ c_1(\\mathcal{L}) \\cap [Y]_{k + 1} = [Z(s)]_k $$ in $\\CH_k(X)$.",
