  "latex": "c^{(p)}(E) = 1 + c_1(E) + \\ldots + c_{p - 1}(E) + c'_p(E|_{X_2}) + c'_{p + 1}(E|_{X_2}) + \\ldots \\in A^{(p)}(X_2 \\to X)",
