  "family": "curve",
  "summary": "Let $X$ be a proper scheme of dimension $\\leq 1$ over a field $k$. Let $\\omega_X^\\bullet$ and $\\omega_X$ be as in Lemma \\ref{lemma-duality-dim-1}.…",
