  "importance": 0.48,
  "family": "curve",
  "summary": "Let $f : T \\to S$ be a morphism of schemes. Let $t \\in T$ with image $s \\in S$. Assume $f$ is flat at $t$, $\\mathcal{O}_{S, s}$ is Noetherian, $f$ is locally of…",
  "detail": "Let $f : T \\to S$ be a morphism of schemes. Let $t \\in T$ with image $s \\in S$. Assume $f$ is flat at $t$, $\\mathcal{O}_{S, s}$ is Noetherian, $f$ is locally of finite type, $t$ is a split node of the fibre $T_s$. Then there exists an $h \\in \\mathfrak m_s^\\wedge$ and an isomorphism $$ \\mathcal{O}_{T, t}^\\wedge \\cong \\mathcal{O}_{S, s}^\\wedge[[x, y]]/(xy - h) $$ of $\\mathcal{O}_{S, s}^\\wedge$-algebras.",
