  "latex": "1 : \\mathcal{I}\\mathcal{F} \\to \\mathcal{F}, \\quad s : \\mathcal{I}\\mathcal{F} \\to \\mathcal{F} \\otimes_{\\mathcal{O}_X}\\mathcal{L}",
  "name": "lemma · Meromorphic functions and sections; Noetherian case",
