  "importance": 0.48,
  "family": "curve",
  "summary": "In the situation of Definition \\ref{definition-strict-transform}. If $X$ is flat over $S$ at all points lying over $Z$, then the strict transform of $X$ is equa…",
  "detail": "In the situation of Definition \\ref{definition-strict-transform}. If $X$ is flat over $S$ at all points lying over $Z$, then the strict transform of $X$ is equal to the base change $X \\times_S S'$. Let $\\mathcal{F}$ be a quasi-coherent $\\mathcal{O}_X$-module. If $\\mathcal{F}$ is flat over $S$ at all points lying over $Z$, then the strict transform $\\mathcal{F}'$ of $\\mathcal{F}$ is equal to the pullback $\\text{pr}_X^*\\mathcal{F}$.",
