  "name": "lemma · Open immersions of locally ringed spaces",
  "en": "lemma-restrict-map-to-opens",
  "importance": 0.48,
  "family": "scheme",
  "summary": "Let $f : X \\to Y$ be a morphism of locally ringed spaces. Let $U \\subset X$, and $V \\subset Y$ be open subsets. Suppose that $f(U) \\subset V$.…",
  "detail": "Let $f : X \\to Y$ be a morphism of locally ringed spaces. Let $U \\subset X$, and $V \\subset Y$ be open subsets. Suppose that $f(U) \\subset V$. There exists a unique morphism of locally ringed spaces $f|_U : U \\to V$ such that the following diagram is a commutative square of locally ringed spaces $$ \\xymatrix{ U \\ar[d]_{f|_U} \\ar[r] & X \\ar[d]^f \\\\ V \\ar[r] & Y } $$",
