  "summary": "Let $f : X \\to Y$ be a closed immersion of locally ringed spaces. Let $\\mathcal{I}$ be the kernel of the map $\\mathcal{O}_Y \\to f_*\\mathcal{O}_X$.…",
  "detail": "Let $f : X \\to Y$ be a closed immersion of locally ringed spaces. Let $\\mathcal{I}$ be the kernel of the map $\\mathcal{O}_Y \\to f_*\\mathcal{O}_X$. Let $i : Z \\to Y$ be the closed subspace of $Y$ associated to $\\mathcal{I}$. There is a unique isomorphism $f' : X \\cong Z$ of locally ringed spaces such that $f = i \\circ f'$.",
