  "summary": "Here we are given a commutative diagram of rings $$ \\xymatrix{ A \\ar[r] & K \\\\ R \\ar[u] \\ar[r] & B \\ar[u] } $$ where $K$ is a field and $A$, $B$ are subrings of…",
  "detail": "Here we are given a commutative diagram of rings $$ \\xymatrix{ A \\ar[r] & K \\\\ R \\ar[u] \\ar[r] & B \\ar[u] } $$ where $K$ is a field and $A$, $B$ are subrings of $K$ with fraction field $K$. Finally, $R = A \\times_K B = A \\cap B$.",
